JSX- Javascript XML OR extension
witht he help of jsx we can write and add html in react
jsx xonverts html tags into react element.
its not compulsory to use react

rules for writing JSX
 1. Html code must wrap into one top level element.
 2. elements must be closed.
 3. attributes class= classname
 4. no if else condition inside jsx but ternary operator is okay
 5. js expression in jsx must wrapped in {}.


